 "family": "Every RD-type cell Z(h1..h4) with sum mu_i h_i = 0, mu_i > 0, has exactly three free directions (besides its own four): u_{ij|kl} = mu_i h_i + mu_j h_j, the line shared by the planes of h_i, h_j and of h_k, h_l. Z(h1..h4, s u) is an elongated dodecahedron for every s > 0 (stretch = Minkowski sum with a segment; Delone free direction; #49). Any fifth direction outside these three lines leaves a belt of 8 faces (Venkov), so no tiling. Parameters: lattice (six sliders), Cell t, partition ij|kl, stretch s.",
